# Every text file is stored with LF. On Windows the page generators (gen:faq, gen:learn) write CRLF; with this, git
# compares the content only, so a deploy no longer leaves 10 "changed" files that differ just in line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# The built house app is copied as-is (npm run house:sync) — never touch its bytes.
public/house/** -text
